===Etymology===
{{root|sv|ine-pro|*h₂neḱ-}}
From {{inh|sv|non|nær}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*nēhwiz}}, comparative of {{m|gem-pro|*nēhw}}. Ultimately from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*h₂neḱ-||to reach}}.

